      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也会尽最大之力继续赢得胜利。\n用最完美的表现\n迎接目白家重视的春季竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a22672d641b1bc997b758cc6f6b3fa24498e36d98ebb4a9221dbf382fcae7d56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
