    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e6d56a3753d05bd65a856f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小风，你就继续跑步吧。\n这是我们一起讨论出来的结论。\n所以你就别担心家里的事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b712270c9b6215bcb6cd1a81006ad971567512b1cba94f2906ef3bf395ac99b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031310.json",
      "json_path": [
